\par
\b 2. What The Client Needs To Do\b0\par
\par
1. Confirm QuickBooks Web Connector is installed on the Windows machine/server that can access the production QuickBooks company file.\par
2. Open QuickBooks Desktop as Admin in the target production company file.\par
3. Open QuickBooks Web Connector.\par
4. Import the Corelytics .qwc file provided above.\par
5. Enter the Web Connector password provided separately by Corelytics.\par
6. Approve the QuickBooks integrated application prompt for Corelytics.\par
7. Allow access when QuickBooks is not running, if prompted, so scheduled syncs can run.\par
8. Keep the QuickBooks host machine online during the agreed sync window.\par
9. Coordinate with Corelytics for the first test sync and validation.\par
\par
